%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a996e19c4d83684a905dbed745d44a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: SOCutscene_Feed_Round2Arrive
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIandCinematic.SOCutscene
  _endBlendSeconds: 1
  _steps:
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "드디어 도착했네! 여기가 피드 맨 꼭대기야."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "재료도 다섯 개 모았고… 이제 뭘 하면 돼?"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey: Feed_Round2Console
    Message: "저기 가운데 있는 기계 보이지? 저걸 작동시키면 아래에 있던 피드들이 이쪽으로 올라올 거야."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "피드들이 올라온다고? 왜?"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "그 피드들을 먼저 정리해야 폰 주인의 노래를 올릴 수 있거든."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "그럼 피드들을 정리하고 나서 올리는 거구나."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey: Feed_Round2Console
    Message: "맞아! 일단 기계에 다가가서 E키를 눌러 봐. 재료가 하나라도 부족하면 작동하지 않으니까 확인하고!"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "좋아. 이제 거의 다 왔네!"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
